{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dd18b57cdfa06f1126689c903e6bdd148ddb9601882aebffd2ad082549b8298c", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ特集。\n今日は、朋花の撮影が進んでいる……）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑。今天，朋花的拍摄正在进行中……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "0b1dfd003ea9a79c0f1854d563519b7239fe571fbc3013ee997b759fba445a47", "ja": "ありがとうございました～。\n後半もよろしくお願いします～。……ふぅ。", "zh": "非常感谢大家～。\n后半段也请多多关照咯～。……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "69633c7c31a6ca9b2666fa9d7ff1b0d0270953cd73bebca58144be96e4b211cb", "ja": "お疲れ様、朋花。ここまで順調だな。", "zh": "辛苦了，朋花。到目前为止一切顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "a5bf1d6804e2eaf6f318e3cce2821dbb66958cc9523211a301cb621fd72673b2", "ja": "あら～？　これで順調に見えるだなんて……\n{$P$}さんの目は節穴ですか～？", "zh": "哎呀～？居然觉得这样就算顺利……\n\n{$P$}先生的眼睛是摆设吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fb3d41e44e9e2c57f64936bd7907e0e606830282b8149488516a3a6de45b2fc5", "ja": "えっ！\nもしかして、何か問題でもあったのか？", "zh": "诶！\n难道是出了什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "5542f81c1f52cea31c2caa3bb60db8a6f865b1d83a5aa5fad9a8b28c1a482e30", "ja": "では、質問です。あなたは、\n今の私の姿を見て、何か感じることはありませんか～？", "zh": "那么，我来提问。你看着现在的我，难道没有什么感觉吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1006_p", "source_sha256": "12657b797069292ab1aacffa063084cc66d8866d723ab0c3713f0510dad779d0", "ja": "そうだな……。\nなんというか、新鮮だなと……。", "zh": "是啊……\n该怎么说呢，总觉得很新鲜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "1b999b63c8a389e55aeb0c96718f4710167360605bbb6a39c2321bbc1bfd7d05", "ja": "では、次の質問です。もしプライベートで、\nこのような格好をしていたら、どう思いますか～？", "zh": "那么，接下来是另一个问题。要是我私下里穿成这样，你会怎么想呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d449dd23e8ff07df8e546c252e996d1e8f66e9d29717980945cb2ad37e67180c", "ja": "それは……。\nだいぶ驚くと思う。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n我应该会相当吃惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "1b1c9b5ae1ed7d74c093171a7bf68418aa9ce72cce612358aae8d25e98302ec7", "ja": "そうですよね～。ですから、考えていたんです。\nプライベートな雰囲気をどこまで出していいのか……。", "zh": "是啊～。所以，我一直在考虑。\n私下的氛围究竟展现到什么程度才合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "7e6e3374160c7bcd2efed56dcfd0622e7125576267781f7d81b90e4b0cbd7e9f", "ja": "見慣れた聖母の姿と、かけ離れてしまったら……\n子豚ちゃん達が困ってしまうと思うんです。", "zh": "要是和大家所熟悉的圣母形象相差太远……\n我觉得小猪崽们会感到困惑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4bee0e5e89a082027b57781b3687d0d887392c9aea92ad8a9e5141323fb843ea", "ja": "たしかに、そういう人もいるかもしれないけど……。\nでも、プライベート感を出しても平気じゃないかな？", "zh": "确实，或许也有人会这么想……不过，展现出一些私下的感觉，应该也没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "65b304205074e5660f6ff14497a57869d192dc0e67046ca2f554e5e08d49b0e5", "ja": "ふふっ。ずいぶん自信のある言い方ですね～。\nその理由を聞かせてもらっても？", "zh": "呵呵，真是自信满满的说法呢～。可以告诉我这么说的理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1013_p", "source_sha256": "964a7af3dce2994f675cc1a390035a561e5d8ac6d4ab4736e6b6e5684571ee56", "ja": "ああ。子豚ちゃん達は、朋花のことが大好きだから。\nそれが理由かな。", "zh": "是啊。因为小猪们都非常喜欢朋花。\n这算是理由吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5e460e380326f5d663e541f99045b8695e00997184787dfec6c50d808a286313", "ja": "好きな人のことは、誰だって知りたい。\nまあ、これは仕事で本当のプライベートではないけど。", "zh": "谁都想多了解自己喜欢的人嘛。\n不过，虽然这只是工作，并非真正的私生活就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "377226b533b53edd8f8aa9fcd47ed51b74778a629d76cb9223a8f6d4bc6d13ee", "ja": "なるほど……。子豚ちゃん達は\n聖母のプライベートな姿が見たいと……。", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，小猪们想看看圣母私下的模样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "5879a66bf1da8fb03013adc7532881e34768fc021fbba1e92364dae8d5efbc5d", "ja": "すべては見せられませんが、少しならいいでしょう～。\n子豚ちゃんと、{$P$}さんのために。", "zh": "不能全部给你们看，不过稍微展示一点还是可以的～。  \n为了小猪猪们，还有{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1017_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0313_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "044c34409fb352b1667a1d011095fe73d3e344fd1d23e1295ee5394fb983dbbd", "ja": "求めに応じるのも、聖母の務めということです。\n期待しててくださいね～。うふふ♪", "zh": "回应您的请求，也是圣母的职责。\n请期待吧～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
